  "content": "<p>（临时标志）</p><p>在使用BlueMap时，我希望动态树的树枝能够渲染出来，所以我将树枝模型替换成了Minecraft的六面木头模型。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>只有在有需求时，我才会添加和更新这个资源包，所以欢迎留下评论。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>进行中：无</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>当前兼容的Mod：</p><p>秋意 (Autumnity)</p><p>生物群落丰富 (Biomes'o'Plenty)</p><p>生态学 (Ecologics)</p><p>自然之息 (Nature's Aura)</p><p>新北欧 (Neopolitan)</p><p>夸克 (Quark)</p><p>吸血鬼 (Vamparism)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>祝您玩得愉快！</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mcCxzuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Discord-logo.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></a><br><br>点击下方图片获取廉价可靠的服务器托管服务！<a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-weight:400\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d776\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/698115/description_5136b3ef-2285-459e-91c4-7bde7e032d16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"845\" height=\"300\"></a></p>",
